Description:
Container runtime sandbox with user-space system call virtualization (Sentry) and isolated LISAFS filesystem proxy (Gofer).

Local Modifications:
- Provides syscall isolation profiles and Cloud Run (europe-west9) sandbox descriptors for yolo-bun.
